<https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/educational-indicators> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "ERIC scope note: Measures of the outcomes of educational institutions, programs, and practices, where resulting statistics are intended to inform educational policy" <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/educational-indicators/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/educational-indicators> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/Definition> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/educational-indicators/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/educational-indicators> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Measures used to describe educational conditions, activities, or outcomes and to inform evaluation, comparison, and policy decisions." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/educational-indicators/versions/1> .
